            "resource": "quadratic-sign-reading",
            "note": "本题 $8k^2+8k=8k(k+1)<0$，取两根之间：$-1<k<0$；再与这种情况的前提 $k<0$ 取交集，仍是 $-1<k<0$。"
          },
          "title": "求参数范围",
          "position": 5
        },
        "d_merge": {
          "refs": [
            "method-discriminant#merge"
          ],
          "tip": {
            "ref": "method-discriminant#merge",
            "resource": "case-merge-union",
            "note": "本题情况①得 $k=0$，情况②得 $-1<k<0$；两种情况是“或”的关系，取并集得 $-1<k\\le0$。"
          },
          "title": "合并两种情况",
          "position": 6
        },
        "d_boundary": {
          "refs": [
            "function-range-extrema#attainability"
          ],
          "tip": {
            "ref": "function-range-extrema#attainability",
            "resource": "attainability-boundary",
            "note": "本题 $k=-1$ 时左边是 $-(x+1)^2$，在 $x=-1$ 处等于 $0$，不满足“$<0$”，排除；$k=0$ 时是 $-2<0$，保留。"
          },
          "title": "检查边界",
          "position": 7
        }
      },
      "label": "判别式法"
    }
